"HRC42.04412(a) - Interference with an investigation: Throughout the duration of the investigation which began in October 2021, the provider has failed to cooperate with Child Care Regulation Unregulated Operations Inspectors at 16 attempted investigation inspections. Due to the providers lack of cooperation during the investigation, an Access Order was obtained on March 24, 2022, requiring the provider allow inspectors to inspect the home and review records.  Multiple inspections were attempted on six different days, since the access order was issued, with law enforcement support, and the provider is still failing to cooperate with inspectors and continues to deny access to inspectors with confirmed children in care.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026640418","violation_type_title":"HRC42.04412(a) - Interference with an investigation (26 TAC §HRC42.04412(a) - Interference with an in)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1389433-i20211004-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-hrc42-052-d-ap-illegal-operation-no","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1389433-i20211004","date":"2021-10-04","original_code":"HRC42.052(d) - AP Illegal Operation - No","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-04-12","finding":"HRC42.052(d) - AP Illegal Operation - Not Registered: Throughout the course of the investigation, inspectors have observed at least four unrelated children in care.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026644403","violation_type_title":"HRC42.052(d) - AP Illegal Operation - Not Registered (26 TAC §HRC42.052(d) - AP Illegal Operation - No)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"}]}],"geo":{"state":{"code":"TX","name":"Texas"},"county":{"fips":"48491","name":"Williamson County"},"zip":"78641","city":"Leander"},"related":{"same_operator":[],"same_operator_total":0,"same_building":[],"same_address_other_authority":[],"nearby":[]}}
